Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='syncanddeepsearch', at=datetime(2026, 10, 17, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='The routine sync covers INBOX plus 7 days; older mail needs backfill or search_older', body='*"Found nothing" requires "here\'s what I searched."* Corpus limits: the routine sync (every 5 min since 2026-09-01; a stale unit in \\~/.config shadowed it before) = INBOX + 7 days; anything older or elsewhere needs `backfill`, or the secretary\'s `search_older` (2026-10-17, `suzatary_core::mail::older`): a typed query asked of each account\'s server for dates before the routine window, at most 25 pulled per account into a leaf of its own, its answer naming what was and was not searched.', rationale='The sync runs every 5 minutes since 2026-09-01; before that a stale unit in ~/.config shadowed it. search_older was added 2026-10-17.', supersedes=()))